description:
Letters from the clock. An entry sends a fixed text to a mailbox every N cycles (at cycles N, 2N, 3N...). Leave out box to send to your own queue: the text then wakes you up as a user message every N cycles. op is add, rm or ls. Examples:
- wake me every 10 cycles: {"op": "add", "name": "check-inbox", "every": 10, "text": "Check data/ for new files."}
- remove it: {"op": "rm", "name": "check-inbox"}
- list all entries: {"op": "ls"}
Errors: ArgumentsBad, OpUnknown, EntryExists, EntryMissing, ClockMissing, RegisterBad, WriteFailed.
Details: memory clock.json.
